{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gny5sjyp","slideIndex":12,"text":"正文中的文献均可通过这里的链接追溯。SEATrack作为基线和问题背景；局部自相似性及相似性保持蒸馏提供关系建模启发，但不是当前损失的直接有效性证明。本地数据包括基线完整指标报告、第20轮权重清单、固定序列的预测与矩阵，以及服务器原始日志。数据与图片均为已执行结果，没有把未来实验的期望写成已有结果。\nSu et al. SEATrack: Simple, Efficient, and Adaptive Multimodal Tracker. CVPR 2026. https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12502\nShechtman & Irani. Matching Local Self-Similarities across Images and Videos. CVPR 2007. https://www.wisdom.weizmann.ac.il/~vision/VideoAnalysis/Demos/SelfSimilarities/SelfSimilarities_ShechtmanIrani07.pdf\nTung & Mori. Similarity-Preserving Knowledge Distillation. ICCV 2019, 1365–1374. https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_ICCV_2019/html/Tung_Similarity-Preserving_Knowledge_Distillation_ICCV_2019_paper.html\n本地资料：本科毕业设计任务书；师兄的想法与建议；复现日志.md；汇报/结果目录。"}